body:
Owner-facing progress of the MAIN SESSION on the error-bound aim (#727), posted every 90 minutes by the meta session (owner request, 2026-09-30). The newest comment is the current state; older comments stay as history.

Each update gives:

1. whether the main is running (tmux `qpbt`, thread, goal state) and what it is doing now;
2. the state of the aim's issues and PRs (surveys #727, LDT #728, QPBT #729, report #730, structural #734/#735, protocol amendment #732): open, merged, blocked;
3. workers in use (slots on the space-3 key), key health, goal keeper;
4. blockers, and whether they need the owner.

Owner questions about the numbers go in replies here; the meta answers on the next update or sooner.
